    "message": "docs: verify open TODOs and record author decisions\n\nReview of all TODO markers in the repository and the Obsidian vault.\nFacts checked against primary sources (GitHub, AWS, tool docs,\nNIST SP 800-204D, OWASP, SLSA, bibliographic catalogues) are recorded\nin docs/weryfikacja-todo-2026-11-16.md together with the author's\ndecisions on open questions.\n\n- ADRs 0001-0035: close TODOs with sourced facts; decisions unchanged\n  (new ADR README rules 8 and 9)\n- AGENTS.md rule 5: base SHA pinning on OWASP CICD-SEC-8, not 800-204D\n- add LICENSE (MIT, code) and LICENSE-docs.md (CC BY 4.0, docs and data)\n- metodyka: fix Humble2010 citation (p. 120, ch. 5), sources for M2,\n  analysis stack (Python, pandas, scipy)\n- PROTOCOL P2: scanner settings (direct CLI, --ignore-unfixed,\n  --skip-check-update, ZAP Origin replacer, shared uv.lock check);\n  single deployment environment\n- ground-truth: GT-11 on unencrypted EBS, GT-07 without fastapi extras\n- notes, tools, costs and source verification updated\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
    "timestamp": "2026-11-16T14:17:09Z",
